      <li>See <a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/applications/creating_applications/odc-creating-applications-using-developer-perspective#odc-importing-codebase-from-git-to-create-application_odc-creating-applications-using-developer-perspective">Importing a codebase from Git to create an application</a> for more information on creating an application from Git.</li>
      <li>See <a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/applications/odc-exporting-applications#odc-exporting-applications">Exporting applications</a>.</li>
      </ul>
      </section>
